OL,3,AUS pressures Europe to release diesel
OL,4,Areserves as Trump threatens export ban
OL,5,
OL,6,FDonald Trump has said he may ask
OL,7,FEuropean countries to release some of
OL,8,Ftheir diesel reserves as he considers
OL,9,Fbanning US exports of the fuel.
OL,11,FThe president's comment comes after
OL,12,Fdiesel prices hit record highs on UK
OL,13,Fforecourts this week, as the Iran war
OL,14,Fcontinues to put pressure on the supply
OL,15,Fof refined fuels.
OL,17,FThe UK is heavily reliant on imported
OL,18,Fdiesel from the US. But with US voters
OL,19,Falso facing higher fuel costs ahead of
OL,20,Fthe midterm elections in November,
OL,21,FTrump has threatened to restrict diesel
OL,22,Fexports.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
