OL,3,AUS pressures Europe to release diesel
OL,4,Areserves as Trump threatens export ban
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe UK has been discussing the US
OL,7,Fsupply threats with the EU which is
OL,8,Fholding a meeting on Friday on the
OL,9,Fissue.
